- [Machine tools and precision production infrastructure](machine-tools-and-precision-production-infrastructure/Machine-tools-and-precision-production-infrastructure.lingua#r_54AAZ2Y0HK952ZRH8YCYBHJDPA)
- [Textiles, clothing, and technical fabrics](textiles-clothing-and-technical-fabrics/Textiles-clothing-and-technical-fabrics.lingua#r_7J4PQT2PP272F5D218AYG8W3YQ)
- [Timber, paper, and packaging systems](timber-paper-and-packaging-systems/Timber-paper-and-packaging-systems.lingua#r_1EK7CM15ZR70X480KKR4F150KT)
